  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Regional Centers for Learning on Evaluation and Results (CLEAR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This program is envisioned to be a two-phase program, with the first  phase encompassing the first five years.  Objectives of the first  phase of the program are as follows:
 
 1.  Select and support regional academic/training Centers in  Sub-Saharan Africa, East Asia &amp; Pacific, Latin America, and South Asia  to provide demand-driven capacity building services in RBM and M&amp;E on  a regional basis.
 
 2.  Provide a multi-regional forum for exchange of ideas, knowledge,  and information on RBM and M&amp;E systems and methods to enable  practitioners (government and professionals) to learn from each other.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
